Decodelabs 4th task
4'th task in Decodelabs intern trainning using HTML and CSS and JavaScript To make Registration Form Validation project
- Validate: 
- Full Name (minimum 3 characters) 
- Email (valid email format) 
- Phone Number 
- Password (minimum 8 characters, one uppercase letter, one number) 
- Confirm Password 
- Show error messages below each input. 
- Show success message when the form is valid. 
- Prevent form submission if validation fails. 
- Green border for valid inputs. 
- Red border for invalid inputs. 
- Show/Hide Password button.
